# apps/jeopardy — local Pages Functions config for `npm run dev:functions`.
# Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored) and fill in. NEVER commit the real file.
#
# SUPABASE_URL already comes from wrangler.toml [vars] — only the secret and
# the dev identity belong here.

# Service-role key. You already have a copy in bots/musix-discord/.env, and it
# is a Pages secret on the account project. Server-side only — it must never
# appear in src/ or in a VITE_ variable.
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=<paste-the-service-role-key>

# ── Local dev identity ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The real session cookie is Domain=.gokkehub.com + Secure, so the browser will
# never send it to http://localhost — you cannot log in locally. With this set,
# functions/_session.ts treats requests as coming from this user, but ONLY when
# the request arrives at localhost/127.0.0.1. Leave it unset to test the real
# "signed out" behaviour.
#
# Use your own user id (= your Discord id — there is no Supabase auth user), so
# the games you already own show up in the dashboard.
DEV_USER_ID=<your-discord-user-id>
DEV_USER_NAME=Dev Host
